WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:03,260
Seeds

2
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:07,720
Steel gun head with wooden handle and loose paper to restore the steel gun

3
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,060
Melee weapons have finally been upgraded

4
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:14,410
This man didn't die of illness

5
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:16,810
There may have been other dangers in the past besides the beasts.

6
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:18,820
The two holes are different

7
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:19,820
Either someone has moved

8
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:21,620
Either the attack didn't come from the same direction

9
00:00:21,620 --> 00:00:24,020
Just because you were injured by a sword, you cannot directly conclude that it was done by someone else.

10
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,420
The guide may also have a magnetic monitoring trap

11
00:00:25,950 --> 00:00:27,550
and even other unknown things

12
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:30,200
If there is insufficient evidence, don’t draw any conclusions yet.

13
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,200
The most important thing now

14
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:33,200
It's to bring back the usable steel guns and seeds.

15
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:38,910
First repair of steel weapons

16
00:00:38,910 --> 00:00:40,510
Strength-boosting survival information

17
00:00:40,910 --> 00:00:42,710
There are natural hot springs above the cave

18
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:44,310
I've lived down there for so long

19
00:00:44,310 --> 00:00:45,510
There is also a hot spring up there

20
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,620
After Fang Cai and weapons are stabilized,

21
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:50,820
Let’s find out how those victims died.

22
00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:52,420
Looking at the clues separately, they are all coincidences

23
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:55,220
Once we find the third place, we’ll have a first-level team
